# Wrrapd.com color schema (shopper site)

**Scope:** `wrrapd.com` shopper UI only (header, footer, account, login/register). Do **not** invent a new yellow. Contractor portals (`apply` / `pros`) keep their own CSS.

## Logo gold (required for primary buttons)

Sampled from the **p** and **d** in the Wrrapd wordmark (`Wrrapd_f-Logo`):

| Token | Hex | Use |
|---|---|---|
| `WRRAPD_LOGO_GOLD` | **`#f6b933`** | Primary buttons, footer CTA, logged-in pills, auth submit |
| Navy | **`#0f0351`** | Footer background, button text on gold |
| Ink | **`#162a52`** | Secondary navy / links |

PHP constant: `WRRAPD_LOGO_GOLD` in `wordpress/wrrapd-orders-bridge.php`.

## Never use these on wrrapd.com shopper buttons

- Neon / highlighter yellow: `#f7ff00`, `#fff300`, `#ff0`
- Plugin default blue (Ultimate Member, Essential Addons, User Registration): `#3ba1da`, `#0693e3`, `#8ed1fc`, `#1877F2`

If a plugin ships a blue or neon button, override it to `#f6b933` with `#0f0351` text.

## Where it is wired

- Footer CTA + headings: `wrrapd_output_site_footer_css()` (`--wf-gold`)
- Logged-in header pills (Hot Gifts / Your orders): `wrrapd_output_header_member_css()`
- Login / register / password reset: `wordpress/wrrapd-auth-critical.css`
- Profile / My Account: `wordpress/wrrapd-account-critical.css`
